#. * duration such as 1:32:10
#, c-format
msgid "Interval: the whole run, 0:00 to %s."
msgstr "Zeitraum: der ganze Abschnitt, 0:00 bis %s."

#. TRANSLATORS: PDF report: heading of the snapshots of older
#. * files, which do not say in which run they were taken
msgid "Other snapshots"
msgstr "Weitere Aufnahmen"

msgid "Snapshots of files written before runs: it is not known in which run they were taken."
msgstr "Aufnahmen aus Dateien von vor den Abschnitten: Es ist nicht bekannt, in welchem Abschnitt sie gemacht wurden."

#. TRANSLATORS: PDF report: heading of the table of the runs on the first page
msgid "Runs"
msgstr "Abschnitte"

#. TRANSLATORS: PDF report, heads of the table of the runs. Short
msgid "Period"
msgstr "Zeitraum"

msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Dauer"

msgid "Positions"
msgstr "Lagen"

msgid "Mean rate"
msgstr "Mittl. Gangabw."

msgid "Mean amp."
msgstr "Mittl. Amplitude"

msgid "Mean B.E."
msgstr "Mittl. Abfallfehler"

#. TRANSLATORS: PDF report, under the table of the runs, after a dot
#. * that marks a run in the table
msgid "The run being recorded when the report was exported."
msgstr "Der Abschnitt, der beim Export des Berichts aufgezeichnet wurde."

#. TRANSLATORS: PDF report, under the heading of the final state of the run being recorded
msgid "The real-time tab when the report was exported; the run goes on."
msgstr "Der Echtzeit-Reiter beim Export des Berichts; der Abschnitt läuft weiter."

#. TRANSLATORS: Export report dialog: the Trend page contents of a run
msgid "This run has no Trend readings."
msgstr "Dieser Abschnitt enthält keine Verlaufsmesswerte."

#. TRANSLATORS: Export report dialog: the real-time tab at the end of a
#. * run. Checked by default only for runs without snapshots
msgid "State when exporting"
msgstr "Stand beim Export"

msgid "Final state"
msgstr "Endstand"

msgid "There is no measurement with a waveform in this run."
msgstr "Dieser Abschnitt enthält keine Messung mit Wellenform."

#. TRANSLATORS: PDF report: heading of the last state of a run; %s is
#. * "Run 2" or "Run 3 (in progress)"
#, c-format
msgid "%s: state when exporting"
msgstr "%s: Stand beim Export"

#, c-format
msgid "%s: final state"
msgstr "%s: Endstand"

msgid "There are no runs in the session."
msgstr "Die Sitzung enthält keine Abschnitte."

#. TRANSLATORS: Export report dialog: snapshots of files written
#. * before runs, which do not say in which run they were taken
msgid "Other snapshots (older files)"
msgstr "Weitere Aufnahmen (ältere Dateien)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Export report dialog: the table of the runs on the first page
msgid "Table of the runs on the first page"
msgstr "Tabelle der Abschnitte auf der ersten Seite"

#. TRANSLATORS: label of the name field on a run tab
msgid "Current run:"
msgstr "Aktueller Abschnitt:"
